  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E-commerce platforms for Women-owned Businesses in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2021, the Vietnam Trade Promotion Agency (VieTrade), in partnership with the Dutch Embassy in Vietnam and SheTrade Hub, initiated the project e-Strengthening Competitiveness for Women-owned Businesses. This project provided vital online business training to empower women entrepreneurs in Vietnam.Despite the global rise of e-commerce, female entrepreneurs, particularly in small and medium-sized businesses, faced challenges due to their limited knowledge of online platforms, hindering their growth potential.To address this, the present project Promote Exports to EU Markets Through E-commerce Platforms for Women-owned Businesses in Vietnam is launched. This initiative aims to bridge the knowledge gap and empower Vietnamese women entrepreneurs in cross-border e-commerce through targeted training and accommodating access to these platforms. Utilizing Alibaba.com, a global business-to-business (B2B) e-commerce giant, ITC-SheTrade will assist female entrepreneurs by facilitating strategic market access and providing local support through the platform&apos;s presence in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
